</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/38ade934-8b50-11f1-aa66-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-28T104900Z-1975321359-UP1EM7S0U1NIE-RTRMADP-3-SOCCER-FRANCE.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/38ade934-8b50-11f1-aa66-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-28T104900Z-1975321359-UP1EM7S0U1NIE-RTRMADP-3-SOCCER-FRANCE.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">8fe99d9c-8b50-11f1-8ea9-d1298e0f6031</guid><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 13:22:34 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>林兰</dc:creator></item><item><category>法国</category><title>波尔多通往西班牙的高铁A63继续停运</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%B3%95%E5%9B%BD/20260728-%E6%B3%A2%E5%B0%94%E5%A4%9A%E9%80%9A%E5%BE%80%E8%A5%BF%E7%8F%AD%E7%89%99%E7%9A%84%E9%AB%98%E9%93%81a63%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E5%81%9C%E8%BF%90</link><description>
